008;29(2):67–75. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [20]. Waterhouse E, Towne A. Seizures in the elderly: nuances in presentation and treatment. Cleve Clin J Med. 2005;72(Supple 3):S26–S37. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [21]. Jozefowicz RF. Neurophobia: the fear of neurology among medical students. Arch Neurol. 1994;51:328. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [22]. Abushouk AI, Duc NM. Curing neurophobia in medical schools: evidence-based strategies. Med Educ Online. 2016;21:32476. Accessed 2019 November15 https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.3402/meo.v21.32476 . [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] [23]. Association of American Medical Colleges . Percentage of medical schools with separate required clerkships by discipline: neurology. [cited 2018. October 16]. https://www.aamc.org/initiatives/cir/406450/05a.html Associated Data This section collects any data citations, data availability statements, or supplementary materials included in this article. Data Citations American Medical Association . Accelerating change in medical education. [cited 2018. September 13]. www.changemeded.org USA Medical Licensing Examination, Step 1 . [cited 2019. November 15] https://www.usmle.org/step-1/',27,'2025-10-08 11:08:11','2025-10-08 11:08:11');
